<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{width:1200px;height:630px;overflow:hidden}
body{position:relative;background:#fff;font-family:'Noto Sans JP',sans-serif;color:#17181c;
 background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(46,134,211,.06) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(46,134,211,.06) 1px,transparent 1px),radial-gradient(120% 100% at 100% 0%,#e8eff8 0%,#ffffff 62%);
 background-size:48px 48px,48px 48px,100% 100%}
.hz{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;height:14px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#2E86D3 0 22px,#0e0e0f 22px 44px)}
.hz.t{top:0}.hz.b{bottom:0}
.wrap{position:absolute;left:76px;top:70px;right:60px}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:2px solid #cfd8e5;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:9px 16px;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#30343b}
.chip i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E86D3;display:block}
h1{margin-top:26px;font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16}
h1 .s{display:block;font-size:46px}
h1 .l{display:block;font-size:84px;color:#2E86D3;letter-spacing:.01em;line-height:1.14}
.sub{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sub span{font-weight:700;font-size:25px;padding:6px 14px;border-left:5px solid #2E86D3;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92)}
.foot{position:absolute;left:76px;bottom:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.foot img{height:46px;width:auto;display:block}
.foot b{font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700}
.gear{position:absolute;right:-70px;top:170px;width:430px;height:430px;opacity:.10}
</style></head><body>
<div class="hz t"></div>
<svg class="gear" viewBox="-62 -62 124 124"><g><circle r="46" fill="none" stroke="#17181c" stroke-width="14"/><g fill="#17181c"><rect x="-6" y="-58" width="12" height="16"/><rect x="-6" y="42" width="12" height="16"/><rect x="-58" y="-6" width="16" height="12"/><rect x="42" y="-6" width="16" height="12"/><rect x="-44" y="-44" width="14" height="12" transform="rotate(45)"/><rect x="30" y="-44" width="14" height="12" transform="rotate(-45)"/><rect x="-44" y="32" width="14" height="12" transform="rotate(-45)"/><rect x="30" y="32" width="14" height="12" transform="rotate(45)"/></g><circle r="10" fill="#2E86D3"/></g></svg>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="chip"><i></i>生産設備屋のイヌ × Lorenics</div>
  <h1><span class="s">「生産設備屋のイヌ」が、</span><span class="l">設備を社内で直せる<br>現場へ。</span></h1>
  <div class="sub"><span>PLC教育</span><span>FA制御技術顧問</span><span>AI導入×業務改善</span></div>
</div>
<div class="foot"><img src="../../images/lorenics-logo.png" alt=""><b>ロアニクス株式会社</b></div>
<div class="hz b"></div>
</body></html>
